# ==============================================================================
# MINDMARK (BULLSEYE) — .gitignore
# AI-Powered Financial Market Learning & Paper Trading Platform
# ==============================================================================
#
# ==============================================================================
# 📦 REQUIRED DEPENDENCIES TO RUN THIS PROJECT
# ==============================================================================
# The files and directories ignored below (such as node_modules/, venv/, dist/,
# and .env) must NOT be committed to git. Instead, install them as follows:
#
# 1. SYSTEM PREREQUISITES:
#    - Node.js: >= 18.0.0 (Recommended: v20.x or v22.x LTS)
#    - npm: >= 9.0.0 (or yarn / pnpm)
#    - Python: >= 3.10 (Tested on Python 3.10 - 3.14)
#    - pip: Python package installer
#
# 2. FRONTEND DEPENDENCIES (Installed via: `npm install`):
#    Production:
#      - react (^18.3.1): Core UI library
#      - react-dom (^18.3.1): DOM rendering for React
#      - react-router-dom (^6.28.0): Client-side routing and page navigation
#      - lucide-react (^1.16.0): Modern fintech & trading icon suite
#      - clsx (^2.1.1): Utility for conditional class names
#      - tailwind-merge (^2.5.5): Utility to merge Tailwind CSS classes safely
#    Development:
#      - vite (^6.0.1): Next-generation frontend build tool and dev server
#      - typescript (^5.6.3): Type safety across components and services
#      - @vitejs/plugin-react (^4.3.4): React Fast Refresh plugin for Vite
#      - tailwindcss (^3.4.16): Utility-first CSS framework
#      - postcss (^8.4.49): CSS transformations
#      - autoprefixer (^10.4.20): Vendor prefixes for CSS rules
#      - jsdom (^29.1.1) & @types/jsdom (^30.0.0): Headless DOM emulation
#      - @types/react (^18.3.12) & @types/react-dom (^18.3.1): TypeScript definitions
#
# 3. BACKEND DEPENDENCIES (Installed via: `pip install -r backend/requirements.txt`):
#    - fastapi (>=0.110.0): High-performance async REST API framework
#    - uvicorn (>=0.28.0): Lightning-fast ASGI web server implementation
#    - pydantic (>=2.7.0): Data validation and parsing using Python type hints
#    - pydantic-settings (>=2.2.0): Typed configuration and environment management
#    - pyjwt (>=2.8.0): JWT token generation, encoding, and authentication
#    - httpx (>=0.27.0): Async HTTP client for external APIs & market feeds
#    - google-generativeai (>=0.4.0): Google Gemini 1.5 Flash AI integration
#    - python-dotenv (>=1.0.0): Load environment variables from .env files
#
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. DEPENDENCY DIRECTORIES (Do NOT commit — restore with npm install / pip install)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
